---
layout: base.njk
title: Admin Dashboard
description: "Administration tools for the I-PACE Owners Advocacy Group."
noindex: true
permalink: /admin/
adminDashboard: true
---

{% from "partials/auth-login-gate.njk" import authLoginGate %}

<div class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="page-header__eyebrow">Admin</p>
    <h1 class="page-header__title">Dashboard</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="container" data-admin-container>
    {{ authLoginGate("admin-dashboard-email", "Sign in required", "Enter your admin email address and we will send a secure sign-in link.", "admin", false) }}

    <div class="auth-gate" data-admin-only-gate hidden>
      <div class="auth-gate__icon" aria-hidden="true">⛔</div>
      <h2 class="auth-gate__title">Access restricted</h2>
      <p class="auth-gate__body">This dashboard is for group administrators only.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="auth-content" data-admin-content hidden>
      <div class="stack">
        <section class="dashboard-panel" data-campaign-summary data-summary-endpoint="/api/admin/campaign-summary" aria-labelledby="campaign-summary-title">
          <div class="dashboard-panel__header"><div><p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Campaign performance</p><h2 class="dashboard-panel__title" id="campaign-summary-title">Email and social overview</h2><p>Email delivery feedback is reconciled with Resend. Instagram engagement comes from Meta when Insights access is configured.</p></div><button type="button" class="btn btn--secondary" data-campaign-summary-refresh>Refresh stats</button></div>
          <p data-campaign-summary-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading campaign totals…</p>
          <div class="grid grid--3 campaign-summary-grid" data-campaign-summary-cards></div>
        </section>

        <div>
          <p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Active tools</p>
          <h2>Administration and member growth</h2>
          <p>Review live submissions, help owners find the group, and run controlled email and Instagram campaigns.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid--3 admin-dashboard-grid">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="admin-tool-logo" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none">
                <path d="M11 7H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v17h20V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
                <path d="M12 4h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4H10V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
                <path d="m11 18 3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card__title">Review queue</h3>
            <div class="card__body"><p>Inspect Join submissions and vehicle records loaded through the server-verified admin API.</p></div>
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/admin/review-queue/">Review Queue</a>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="admin-tool-logo" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M18.2 28V17.1h3.7l.5-4.2h-4.2v-2.7c0-1.2.4-2.1 2.1-2.1h2.3V4.3c-.4-.1-1.8-.2-3.3-.2-3.3 0-5.5 2-5.5 5.7v3.1H10v4.2h3.8V28h4.4Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card__title">Facebook outreach</h3>
            <div class="card__body"><p>Build manual Facebook searches and draft helpful, transparent responses to owners.</p></div>
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/admin/outreach/">Facebook Assistant</a>
          </article>
          <article class="card card--accent">
            <div class="admin-tool-logo" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none">
                <rect x="4" y="7" width="24" height="18" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
                <path d="m5 9 11 9 11-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card__title">Email campaigns</h3>
            <div class="card__body"><p>Preview and send registration reminders or member-referral campaigns in resumable batches.</p></div>
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/admin/email-campaigns/">Email Campaigns</a>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="admin-tool-logo" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none">
                <rect x="4" y="4" width="24" height="24" rx="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
                <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
                <circle cx="23.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card__title">Instagram campaigns</h3>
            <div class="card__body"><p>Review a chat-prepared Reel and caption, then publish only after an exact confirmation.</p></div>
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/admin/instagram-campaigns/">Instagram Campaigns</a>
          </article>
        </div>

        <section class="dashboard-panel" aria-labelledby="planned-admin-title">
          <div class="dashboard-panel__header"><div><p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Planned</p><h2 class="dashboard-panel__title" id="planned-admin-title">Future administration areas</h2></div></div>
          <p>Submission triage, evidence files, public-stat controls, exports, member management, and settings will appear here when their server-side workflows are implemented. They are not linked prematurely.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
